{"id":"muh5uj2n-zpg6op","at":"2026-09-25T16:13:47.663Z","listId":"main","label":"Wave 4 — curve correction","author":"user","rationale":"A deck reviewer put the estimated win turn at 6.6 (parent) vs 7.5 (fork) and the measurement holds up: MV<=2 had fallen 30 -> 24 and I had replaced unconditional early ramp (Cultivate, Sakura-Tribe Elder) with conditional late ramp (Awaken the Woods is dead at X=0, Circle of Dreams Druid needs a board, Ancient Greenwarden costs 6) in a package whose whole purpose was to fix being slow. The Ramp & Mana section count went 10 -> 13, which hid the regression. Note Awaken the Woods reads as mana value 2 in every stats tool but really costs 5 at X=3, so the reviewer's 7.5 was optimistic. Reverting the four cards that moved the curve; every cheap converter stays.","entries":[{"op":"add","name":"Cultivate","section":"Ramp & Mana","replaces":"Awaken the Woods"},{"op":"add","name":"Sakura-Tribe Elder","section":"Ramp & Mana","replaces":"Ancient Greenwarden"},{"op":"add","name":"Bitterblossom","section":"Token Engines","replaces":"Mycoloth"},{"op":"add","name":"Verdant Command","section":"Token Engines","replaces":"Circle of Dreams Druid"},{"op":"remove","name":"Awaken the Woods"},{"op":"remove","name":"Ancient Greenwarden"},{"op":"remove","name":"Mycoloth"},{"op":"remove","name":"Circle of Dreams Druid"}],"snapshot":"versions/2026-09-25-1613-main-wave-4-curve-correction.json","before":{"size":{"total":100,"target":100,"lands":36,"nonland":64,"commanders":1},"curve":{"avgMv":3,"avgMvNonZero":3,"histogram":[{"mv":"0","creature":0,"noncreature":0},{"mv":"1","creature":4,"noncreature":4},{"mv":"2","creature":5,"noncreature":11},{"mv":"3","creature":13,"noncreature":9},{"mv":"4","creature":8,"noncreature":2},{"mv":"5","creature":2,"noncreature":3},{"mv":"6","creature":1,"noncreature":0},{"mv":"7+","creature":2,"noncreature":0}]},"types":{"creature":35,"instant":8,"sorcery":4,"artifact":8,"enchantment":10,"planeswalker":0,"battle":0,"land":36},"co