{"id":"mui439c9-nhoy7c","at":"2026-09-26T08:12:21.897Z","listId":"main","label":"Wave 5 — mana back in","author":"user","rationale":"Pilot's call, and they are right: wave 4 reverted four cards on a curve theory and the win turn stayed 7.5, so the curve was never the cause. Their argument for Circle of Dreams Druid is the correct one - 'needs a board' is not a real condition in a deck whose one reliable act is making a board, and bodies are worthless if the mana to use them arrives two turns late. Elvish Mystic joins as a second turn-1 dork. Cuts: Champion of Lambholt is the THIRD combat-dependent finisher behind Craterhoof, Orcrist and Valley Rotcaller, and it is an enabler rather than a kill; Deep Forest Hermit is 5 mana and its Squirrel anthem turns off Skullclamp on every token. Both cuts lower the curve, so this adds mana AND gets cheaper: avg MV 2.89 -> 2.83, MV<=2 26 -> 27.","entries":[{"op":"add","name":"Circle of Dreams Druid","section":"Ramp & Mana","replaces":"Champion of Lambholt"},{"op":"add","name":"Elvish Mystic","section":"Ramp & Mana","replaces":"Deep Forest Hermit"},{"op":"remove","name":"Champion of Lambholt"},{"op":"remove","name":"Deep Forest Hermit"}],"snapshot":"versions/2026-09-26-0812-main-wave-5-mana-back-in.json","before":{"size":{"total":100,"target":100,"lands":36,"nonland":64,"commanders":1},"curve":{"avgMv":2.89,"avgMvNonZero":2.89,"histogram":[{"mv":"0","creature":0,"noncreature":0},{"mv":"1","creature":4,"noncreature":4},{"mv":"2","creature":6,"noncreature":12},{"mv":"3","creature":12,"noncreature":10},{"mv":"4","creature":8,"noncreature":2},{"mv":"5","creature":1,"noncreature":3},{"mv":"6","creature":0,"noncreature":0},{"mv":"7+","creature":2,"noncreature":0}]},"types":{"creature":33,"instant":9,"sorcery":4,"artifact":8,"enchantment":11,"planeswalker":0,"battle":0,"land":36},"color":{"identity":["B","G"],"pips":{"W":0,"U":0,"B":33,"R":0,"G":44},"sources":{"W":10,"U":10,"B":31,"R":10,"G":29}},"roles":{"sections":{"Commander":1,"Lands