.5","label":"MV 5","before":4,"after":3,"delta":-1},{"group":"color","key":"color.sources.G","label":"G sources","before":29,"after":31,"delta":2},{"group":"roles","key":"roles.Ramp & Mana","label":"Ramp & Mana","before":12,"after":14,"delta":2},{"group":"roles","key":"roles.Token Engines","label":"Token Engines","before":15,"after":13,"delta":-2},{"group":"money","key":"money.total","label":"USD","before":2398.45,"after":2415.54,"delta":17.09},{"group":"money","key":"money.PROXY.usd","label":"PROXY USD","before":2398.45,"after":2415.54,"delta":17.09}]}
{"id":"mui4swec-yv4cix","at":"2026-09-26T08:32:18.180Z","listId":"main","label":"Wave 6 — Dina back in","author":"user","rationale":"Pilot corrected my Marionette Apprentice nomination and they were right: it triggers on artifacts hitting the graveyard, and this list has 12 artifact-token sources plus 11 effects that sacrifice or crack one, so with Ninja Pizza every mana made off a Food is a drain to EACH opponent. Marionette stays. Dina instead comes in over Verdant Command. The axis: Dina is a MULTIPLIER on the drain package, not a fifth flat drainer - Blood Artist, Zulaport, Bastion, Cauldron and Nadier's each GAIN life per death, so one creature dying with four of them out is four separate lifegain events and therefore four Dina triggers at each opponent, on top of the original four. 16 lifegain event sources in the list. Verdant Command is the cut because it is the only one-shot left in Token Engines - four bodies once, where everything else there is repeatable or a multiplier. Runner-up cut considered: Bitterblossom, kept because two tokens every upkeep is two Mirkwood Bats triggers every upkeep.","entries":[{"op":"add","name":"Dina, Soul Steeper","section":"Drain Payoffs","replaces":"Verdant Command"},{"op":"remove","name":"Verdant Command"}],"snapshot":"versions/2026-09-26-0832-main-wave-6-dina-back-in.json","before":{"size":{"total":100,"target":100,"lands":36,"nonland":64,"commanders":1},"curve":{"avgMv":2.83,"avgMvNonZero":2.83,"histogram":[{"mv":"0","creature":0,"noncreature":0},{"mv":"1","creature":5,"noncreature":4},{"mv":"2","creature":6,"noncreature":12},{"mv":"3","creature":12,"noncreature":10},{"mv":"4","creature":8,"noncreature":2},{"mv":"5","creature":0,"noncreature":3},{"mv":"6","creature":0,"noncreature":0},{"mv":"7+","creature":2,"noncreature":0}]},"types":{"creature":33,"instant":9,"sorcery":4,"artifact":8,"enchantment":11,"planeswalker":0,"battle":0,"land":36},"color":{"identity":["B","G"],"pips":{"W":0,"U":0,"B":33,"R":0,"G":44},"sources":{